<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SaaslyHubs | Systeme.io Funnel Template</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root{--primary:#065f46;--dark:#0f172a;--blue:#007bff;--slate:#64748b;--bg:#f8fafc}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);background:var(--bg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.logo-bar{background:#fff;padding:20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0}
.logo-text{font-weight:800;font-size:1.5rem;text-transform:uppercase}
.logo-hubs{color:var(--blue)}
.main-wrapper{max-width:1100px;margin:60px auto 100px;padding:0 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr;gap:60px;align-items:start}
.pitch-side{padding-top:10px}
.badge{background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);color:#10b981;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:20px}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-2px}
.hero-p{font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:15px;font-weight:600}
.why-text{font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--slate);margin-bottom:40px;max-width:620px;border-left:3px solid var(--blue);padding-left:20px}
.highlight-box{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:16px;border-left:5px solid var(--primary);box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.05);margin:40px 0}
.feature-list{list-style:none;margin-top:15px}
.feature-list li{font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;align-items:start}
.feature-list li b{color:var(--dark);display:block;font-weight:700}
.feature-list li::before{content:"→";color:var(--primary);font-weight:bold;margin-right:12px}
.optin-side{position:sticky;top:40px}
.optin-card{background:#fff;padding:40px 30px;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;text-align:center}
.mockup-container{margin:0 auto 20px;perspective:1000px}
.mockup-img{width:180px;height:auto;border-radius:4px;transform:rotateY(-5deg) rotateX(5deg);mix-blend-mode:multiply;display:inline-block;transition:.3s}
.mockup-img:hover{transform:rotateY(0deg) rotateX(0deg) scale(1.05)}
.optin-card h3{font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:700}
.spam-warning{font-size:.75rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:10px;font-style:italic}
footer{text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-top:100px}
.legal-btns{margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:15px}
.legal-btn{background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-size:.7rem;text-decoration:none;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;transition:.2s;border:1px solid #e2e8f0}
.legal-btn:hover{background:#e2e8f0;color:var(--dark)}
@media(max-width:900px){.main-wrapper{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.optin-side{position:relative;top:0}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="logo-bar">
<span class="logo-text">SAASLY<span class="logo-hubs">HUBS</span></span>
</div>

<main class="main-wrapper">

<div class="pitch-side">
<span class="badge">Free Funnel Template</span>
<h1>Collect Leads Automatically With Systeme.io</h1>
<p class="hero-p">Plug-and-play funnel template to start generating leads in under an hour.</p>

<p class="why-text">
Many small businesses struggle to attract and capture leads because building funnels is complex and time-consuming. With this free Systeme.io template, you can instantly start collecting leads, nurturing prospects, and turning them into paying customers.
</p>

<div class="highlight-box">
<strong>What's Included in the Free Template:</strong>
<ul class="feature-list">
<li><b>Ready-to-Use Funnel:</b> A complete lead capture funnel with landing page, thank-you page, and email automation.</li>
<li><b>3 Pre-Written Emails:</b> Welcome, guide delivery, and follow-up sequences for faster engagement.</li>
<li><b>Step-by-Step Checklist:</b> Quick setup guide to get your funnel running in under 60 minutes.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>

<div class="optin-side">
<div class="optin-card">
<div class="mockup-container">
<img src="systemeio-funnel-preview.png" alt="Systeme.io Funnel Preview" class="mockup-img">
</div>

<h3>Get Your Free Template</h3>
<p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom:25px;">Everything you need to start collecting leads today.</p>

<!-- Replace this div with your Systeme.io form embed -->
<div class="ml-embedded" data-form="REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_FORM_ID"></div>

<p class="spam-warning">Check your spam or junk folder for your download link.</p>
<div class="legal" style="font-size:.7rem;color:#cbd5e1;margin-top:15px;">Instant access. No credit card required. Unsubscribe anytime.</div>
</div>
</div>

</main>

<footer>
<div class="legal-btns">
<a href="privacy policy.html" class="legal-btn">Privacy Policy</a>
<a href="terms of service.html" class="legal-btn">Terms of Service</a>
</div>

<div style="max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;font-size:0.8rem;color:#64748b;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;">
<strong>About SaaslyHubs:</strong> Independent research hub for CRM, marketing automation and digital growth tools. We publish reviews, comparisons and practical guides.<br><br>
<strong>Contact:</strong> hello@saaslyhubs.com | Stockholm, Sweden
</div>

<p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;">&copy; 2026 SAASLYHUBS</p>

<p style="font-size:.7rem;color:#cbd5e1;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.4;font-style:italic;">
<strong>Affiliate Disclosure:</strong> Some links may be affiliate links. I only recommend tools I personally use.
</p>
</footer>

<script>
(function(w,d,e,u,f,l,n){w[f]=w[f]||function(){(w[f].q=w[f].q||[]).push(arguments);},l=d.createElement(e),l.async=1,l.src=u,n=d.getElementsByTagName(e)[0],n.parentNode.insertBefore(l,n);})
(window,document,'script','https://assets.mailerlite.com/js/universal.js','ml');
ml('account','2222294');
</script>
</body>
</html>
